Our drive system will follow a preset path where it starts beside the end collection bucket, travels forward through the center of the collection area, makes a 180 degree turn, then returns back to the end bucket facing forward. There will be a collection system added onto the front of the chassis that will prevent objects from being entangled in the tires of the collection robot. Our Milestone 3 video and code shows a drive system that is repeatable and demonstrates the full capability of the drive system.

